---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Verify a screenshot"
  ><div class="workspace">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow">LOOK BEYOND THE IMAGE</div><h1>
        A convincing screenshot<br />still needs evidence.
      </h1><p class="lede">
        Select an election notice, headline or political graphic. Cover private
        details, then check the claim against public sources.
      </p>
    </header><p class="notice">
      Paid AI is disabled by default. You can preview and cover private details
      here, then <a href="/investigate/"
        >type or paste the visible claim into Investigate</a
      >. Automatic on-device text extraction is planned, not yet available.
    </p><form id="keo-form" data-mode="verify">
      <label class="upload" for="image-file"
        ><strong>Choose a screenshot or photograph</strong><br /><span
          class="small muted"
          >JPEG, PNG or WebP · up to 8 MB before compression</span
        ><input
          id="image-file"
          type="file"
          accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"
          required
        /></label
      ><div id="image-editor" hidden>
        <p class="small">
          Drag across names, phone numbers and profile pictures to cover them
          before sending.
        </p><canvas
          id="image-canvas"
          class="upload-preview"
          aria-label="Image redaction canvas"></canvas><button
          class="btn"
          id="reset-image"
          type="button">Undo all redactions</button
        ><button class="btn" id="clear-image" type="button">Remove image</button
        >
      </div><label for="query" class="small">Optional context</label><textarea
        id="query"
        maxlength="2000"
        placeholder="What makes this image suspicious?"></textarea><label
        class="consent"
        ><input id="image-consent" type="checkbox" required /><span
          >I have covered unnecessary personal details and agree to send this
          image for AI analysis. KEO removes the temporary image after
          processing. <a href="/about/#privacy">Retention details</a>.</span
        ></label
      ><div class="actions">
        <button class="btn primary" type="submit"
          >Extract & investigate ↗</button
        ><a class="btn" href="/investigate/">Paste text instead</a>
      </div><p id="service-state" class="small muted">
        Checking image verification availability…
      </p><p id="form-error" class="error" role="alert" hidden></p><ol
        id="trace"
        class="trace"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
      </ol>
    </form><div id="result" tabindex="-1"></div><p class="notice">
      An image’s appearance cannot prove authenticity or AI generation. KEO
      checks its visible claim; it does not identify private people.
    </p><noscript
      ><p>
        Image verification needs JavaScript. <a href="/sources/"
          >Open original sources</a
        >.
      </p></noscript
    >
  </div><script>
    import "../scripts/image-editor";
    import "../scripts/investigation";
  </script></Layout
>
